                        "name":  "places/ChIJLVkmDG2pQjQRR5EKba31Bk0/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CWFRGbG9SR3N5ZWxSV1YzaFdZelZZZGxOdWQzYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "On my second visit, I ordered cold noodles, which I really liked. The pork chop, which cost an extra $40, was quite salty.\n\nThe menu was different from typical breakfast shops. The egg pancakes were made with very thin crepes! The chive egg pancakes were filled with the same ingredients as chive boxes, including tofu, glass noodles, and chives! Delicious!\n\nThe radish cake was very soft and tender, and already quite salty; it was better dipped in chili oil.\n\nI recommended the fried sauce noodles to a colleague, and she said it was delicious! 😋",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "二訪點了涼麵，味道很喜歡，肉排加點$40 頗鹹～\n\n和一般早餐店不同的菜單\n蛋餅是用很薄的餅皮去煎恰恰！韭菜蛋餅是包跟韭菜盒子一樣的內容物，有豆乾和冬粉跟韭菜！好吃！\n蘿蔔糕吃起來很軟嫩，已經夠鹹了，可以沾辣油就好。\n推薦同事去吃炸醬麵，她回來說好吃😋",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
